      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Customer",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Samin Ravi\",\n    \"email\": \"mentor.saminravi@gmail.com\",\n    \"password\": \"aA@@@12345678\",\n    \"patient\": {\n        \"contactNumber\": \"+8801700000000\"\n    }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expected: **201**. Creates a `User` (`role: PATIENT`, `emailVerified: false`) and sends a 6-digit OTP to the given email (valid for a limited time). No tokens are issued yet — call **Verify Email** next with the OTP to receive `accessToken`/`refreshToken`.\n\n`patient` is optional; only `contactNumber` is accepted on it at registration time."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Email",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "if (res && res.data && res.data.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", res.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshToken\", res.data.refreshToken || \"\");",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"mentor.saminravi@gmail.com\",\n    \"otp\": \"565173\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "verify-email"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expected: **201**. Confirms the OTP sent by **Register Patient**, marks the user verified, and returns `data: { accessToken, refreshToken, user, patient }` (also set as `accessToken`/`refreshToken` cookies). The test script saves both tokens as collection variables."
          },
          "response": []
        },
