              ]
            },
            "description": "Expected: **200** with `data: { accessToken, refreshToken }` (also set as cookies).\n\nOther outcomes:\n- unknown email → 404\n- `status: BLOCKED` → 403\n- deleted account → 404\n- Google-only account (no password set) → 400\n- wrong password → 401"
          },
