      "description": "All seven credential-auth endpoints under `/api/v1/auth`. `Get Me` is gated by `auth(ADMIN, DOCTOR, PATIENT, SUPER_ADMIN)` — every role passes, so the gate really just means \"authenticated\". Password rule enforced by Zod on register/login/reset: min 8 chars, at least one lowercase, one uppercase, one digit, one special character."
    },
